<title>SWITZERLAND: Sulzer sees double-digit profit growth.</title>
<headline>Sulzer sees double-digit profit growth.</headline>
<dateline>WINTERTHUR, Switzerland 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sulzer AG said the strong rise in 1997 net profit that it predicted earlier would be in the &quot;double digit&quot; range.</p>
<p>Cyril Meier, head of corporate communications, said the rise in this year's net profit would be double-digit, but declined to be more specific.</p>
<p>&quot;It will be a double-digit percentage (rise),&quot; he told reporters before an annual news conference. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
